{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4faf187766de142a6b9aee252b050bc7fb066510ea41b60fa2ef46f3a0c71c38", "ja": "ん？　机の上に、手帳が置きっぱなしになってるな。\n誰のだろう……？", "zh": "嗯？桌上放着一本手帐。\n会是谁的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1001_se", "source_sha256": "7908229f69b9efd12c38693cfd2e1b1bf705f55085250bb6630062118c2c5e0a", "ja": "ペラッ", "zh": "（翻阅）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "2cd1bf381a64170bb63070fa304eac356b133c4920a811b766c78653e752d814", "ja": "あ～っ！？　ちょっと、お兄ちゃんっ！", "zh": "啊～！？大哥哥，等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4a8a4e390e269016f982759df54245025c387c492fb1f3103f8375fcf30e9df5", "ja": "うわっ！　なんだ、桃子か……。\nビックリしたじゃないか。", "zh": "唔哇！什么嘛，原来是桃子啊……\n吓了我一大跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "ef5e76e55f9330a587982e64e501483050f3a3791b47afaed204252f6a32c5c0", "ja": "もうっ、「なんだ」じゃないよ！\nそれは桃子の手帳なんだから、勝手に見ないで！", "zh": "真是的，还敢说「什么嘛」！\n那是桃子的手帐，你不要乱翻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5efda8924044a4c7da9db9fc904420d703a8bd53d07a1c939fc49938916b13ee", "ja": "そうか、桃子のだったのか。\n置きっぱなしだったから、忘れ物かと思ったよ。", "zh": "原来是桃子的啊。\n我看它被丢在桌子上，还以为是谁忘记了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d8fae08cf05103aea31f2cd8d61cb5c17c90e6ece6f87724c3e9bd57a923ae5f", "ja": "なくさないように、鞄にしまっておかないとな。\nほら。", "zh": "得收进包包里面，小心别弄丢喔。\n拿去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "09ab16e500dc4e0319437eaa15d669c2b3651a5b58b41047a2dad184542cfc4b", "ja": "あ、ありがと……じゃなくて！\nお兄ちゃん、中見たでしょ？　今！", "zh": "谢、谢谢……不是啦！\n大哥哥，你看了内容对吧？就在刚才！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bc8c5e212971a5c877934221fe7fabd48a84c87d2fe22886b61f10f259035b23", "ja": "え？\n……いや、どうだったかな……。", "zh": "咦？\n……呃，我不记得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "3215c3e2a1dd7f21a84ceb05486db76f5814bd430301773222a9f425e2582286", "ja": "ウソ！　絶対見てた！\nそんな演技で、桃子の目はごまかせないんだからね。", "zh": "骗人！你一定看了！\n别以为这种演技可以骗过桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1010_p", "source_sha256": "08f8e64bd1179059b85d06822be34e04498cc6619f60d4ebd164023e93f663e7", "ja": "いや、誰の手帳か確かめようとしただけだから……\nかわいいシールが入ってるのは見えたけど。", "zh": "你误会了，我只是确认一下这是谁的手帐而已……\n我是看到里面有可爱的贴纸没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "74b4b0ed58a5fd91aaaa13e749d1cbb869e574720c38e2059dcdb62333aedc47", "ja": "……見たのって、それだけ？\n写真は、見てない？", "zh": "……你看到的就只有这样？\n有没有看到照片？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1012_p", "source_sha256": "bc3a603d790f4d2634cf6fe0b546804ad0b89e4c057e18aa70ec6f1b36b0a362", "ja": "写真？　いや、見てないけど……\n写真が、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "照片？没有，我没有看到……\n照片怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "1835501fb3106fef5588083323cb84844caebf4ca0e9f0040f3da77d566e0716", "ja": "別に、なんでもない！\n……はぁ、よかった……。", "zh": "没事，什么都没有！\n……呼，幸好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "030a5dd016d22830405e1932e511ff86567d9b6d882a8630cf91da063d68b4ac", "ja": "いい？　お兄ちゃん！　手帳はプライバシーの\nかたまりなんだから、勝手に見たらダメだよ！", "zh": "大哥哥！你听好了，手帐可是攸关一个人全部的隐私，\n不可以未经同意就打开来看喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5e8981cf27fb1fb92bfbbc7c1baca53d993de231bc979f2d3d93bfd695ff624e", "ja": "あ、ああ、わかった。\n今度から気を付けるよ。", "zh": "好、好的，我知道了。\n我下次会小心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "1bfad9d57421b57a2ec3b17ae6ccfaa56c5e971a405e09eaa55373db5d236fb3", "ja": "そうそう。いい返事だね♪\nお兄ちゃんも、やればできるんじゃない。", "zh": "没错没错，这样回答就对了♪\n大哥哥有心也是可以的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0043_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "82097a287c59fe759c0d66bbd29346d165292edbcbd027712db6dc01c5228db7", "ja": "これからも、桃子のプライベートを勝手に\nのぞき見したりしちゃダメだからね。約束だよ！", "zh": "今后可不能再擅自偷窥桃子的隐私了喔，\n一言为定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
